	(text "DINO PROTO CARD -- a perfboard with the bus edge and the slot decode every card repeats.\nGenerated by docs/notes/proto_card_gen.py from bus_gen.BUS; design .git/sdd/PROTO_CARD.md.\nJ1 edge: every pin by name. J2: the edge 1:1 on a 2x25 header (pin n = edge pin n), for a 50-way IDC.\nU1 '138 as dino_serial U101: A=M11-M13, E1=~{IO_SEL}, E2=GND, E3=+5V. O0-O7 = slots 0-7 = 0x4000+n*0x800.\nJP1: ONE shunt joins O_n to ~{CARD_SEL} (R1 4.7k up). Two shunts short two '138 outputs.\nU2 '32: ~{CARD_RD} = ~{CARD_SEL}|~{IO_RD_Q}, ~{CARD_WR} = ~{CARD_SEL}|~{IO_WR}; gates 3,4 spare on J4, A inputs pulled.\nJ3: ~{CARD_SEL} ~{CARD_RD} ~{CARD_WR} O0-O7 GND. RB1-RB7: the rail bars (hole strips on the board).\nThe card gives nothing back on any pin (CARD-2). +12V/-12V/+3.3V draw: none; the bodge declares its own."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "fe513767-8ccf-53e5-be4d-57e8e1c3dc6a")
	)
